<title>UK: CSFB sets 250 mln Swiss franc subordinated bond.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets 250 mln Swiss franc subordinated bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT SUISSE FIRST BOSTON, LONDON BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.375     MATURITY  * PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE   SUBORDINATED  ISS PRICE  102.15    PAY DATE    23.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES   *  CALL AT PAR FROM 23.JUL.07, THEREAFTER PAYS 3ML +165</p>
<p>BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A2/A+     DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
